00:02:03.910 --> 00:02:06.314
Let's explain what the
WHO means when they say

00:02:06.314 --> 00:02:08.680
something is a global health emergency.

00:02:08.680 --> 00:02:11.310
Practically speaking, this
is gonna open up avenues

00:02:11.310 --> 00:02:14.840
for networks of communication
between clinical sites,

00:02:14.840 --> 00:02:17.923
research sites, lab sites,
it's going to unlock dollars

00:02:17.923 --> 00:02:20.310
that can be spent for these networks.

00:02:20.310 --> 00:02:23.250
On top of that, WHO is gonna
be able to hold countries

00:02:23.250 --> 00:02:26.026
accountable for reporting
accurate numbers.

00:02:26.026 --> 00:02:28.990
So we know what's going on internationally

00:02:28.990 --> 00:02:30.680
and we can monitor the situation well.

00:02:30.680 --> 00:02:33.070
It does not mean that they labeled it

00:02:33.070 --> 00:02:35.300
a global health emergency
and we should panic.

00:02:35.300 --> 00:02:36.744
In fact, it's the exact opposite.

00:02:36.744 --> 00:02:38.955
They're taking steps to
prevent us from panicking

00:02:38.955 --> 00:02:41.196
by making educated decisions and unlocking

00:02:41.196 --> 00:02:44.546
much needed dollars to
help combat the situation.

00:02:44.546 --> 00:02:47.417
Now moving on to the
